TEXT 0 240 Left 2 !.ac dec 1000 20 20k
TEXT 0 320 Left 2 ;SEAS-style electromechanical model of the MIDRANGE in the DALI box, port closed (Lab D, Fig. 1). Re = 4.6 (lab). Voice coil = Le in series with L2||R2 (eddy-current/lossy-inductance model) so |Z| and phase follow the measurement up to 20 kHz.\nMechanical loop: Mmd = moving mass, Rms = mechanical loss, Cms = EFFECTIVE compliance (suspension in series with the closed-box air spring -> fs = 89 Hz, peak 19 Ohm).\nBl = 5 Tm is a nominal scaling choice: |Z| only depends on Bl^2/Zm, so if you know the real Bl scale Mmd and Rms by (Bl/5)^2 and Cms by (5/Bl)^2. No acoustic section (Sd unknown). Impedance: plot 1/I(Vd1).
